{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1342271-aberrant-i-think-who-is-the-character-in-this-picture","id":1342271,"title":"[Aberrant, I think?] Who is the character in this picture?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-18T21:09:30-07:00","id":1342271,"title":"[Aberrant, I think?] Who is the character in this picture?","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/trinity-continuum-aberrant-gets-twitch-y-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OPP-Metal.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/trinity-continuum-aberrant-gets-twitch-y-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> Trinity Continuum: Aberrant Gets Twitch-y! [Monday Meeting Notes] &ndash; Onyx Path Publishing </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/trinity-continuum-aberrant-gets-twitch-y-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/trinity-continuum-aberrant-gets-twitch-y-monday-meeting-notes/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The top picture, the character with the red cape. Is that a known character or someone new? I'd seen a little of the head and collar before and thought maybe they were Geryon in an armored form, but now I have no idea.<br /> <br /> Speaking of Geryon, assuming this isn't him, is there any picture of him anywhere except the monochrome headshot in Aberrant core? All I've gotten about him is that he has no neck. There's also the guy that Core is fighting on the corner, who has a similar head, but I've always assumed that was Superbeast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T21:12:31-07:00","id":1342272,"title":"","content":"The Gothic Knight. New York City defender, iirc. Was around in 1e but not hugely detailed. <br /> <br /> Geryon is the person fighting Core on the right side of the 1e Aberrant cover. He\u2019s scattered throughout the Teragen book, in the background on p.133, fourth from the left on p.38, and a couple of headshot pictures on p.57.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":156,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","user":"Bunyip","date":". 10-19-2019, 12:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-19T05:00:48-07:00","id":1342329,"title":"","content":"Yep, the Gothic Knight. He's most directly Aberrant's version of Batman, with a dash of characters like Spawn. On the cover of the <b>Aberrant 1e</b> core rulebook, the Gothic Knight is the silhouette at the top right, right next to the T. On the 1e <b>Storyteller Screen</b>, he's <a href=\"https://http2.mlstatic.com/rpg-aberrant-storytellers-screen-white-wolf-1999-ww8501-D_NQ_NP_664133-MLB28675267998_112018-F.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">right in the middle</a> of the left-most (rear) panel (the same illustration in b&amp;w is in the core on p. 98). In the <b>Aberrant Player's Guide</b>, you can see him on p. 79, mentioned on p. 160, and he appears again on p. 162 as the 4th-rated city defender.<br /> <br /> As for Geryon, he is indeed the bulky guy fighting Core on the 1e cover. You can see him off to the left of the Lincoln Memorial fight on p. 87. He's seen lifting a car in <b>Teragen</b> p. 17, he's the guy with the giant arm in the Last Supper illustration on p. 38, two different illos on p. 57, hurling concrete on p. 88, that might be him on p. 105, posing on p. 133. In <b>Worldwide Phase I</b>, he's being blasted on p. 137, and then in <b>Worldwide Phase II</b> he shows up for some smashing on p. 124. He's featured in the Nippontai comic on page 149 of the <b>Aberrant Players Guide</b>.<br /> <br /> That should cover about 90%+ of each of their respective illustrations currently available.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-19T05:03:27-07:00","id":1342330,"title":"","content":"Wow, thanks for the comprehensive info! I've got to go back and check my books with those page numbers in mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}